        "5 0 obj\n<< /Type /Font /Subtype /Type3 /PaintType 2 /FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0] /Encoding << /Differences [65 /A] >> /FirstChar 65 /LastChar 65 /Widths [1000] /CharProcs << /A 7 0 R >> >>\nendobj\n",
        try std.fmt.allocPrint(
